    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"finding a small way to make things better\" feels so... temporary. like putting a band-aid on a gunshot wound. people talk about \"meaning\" and \"resilience\" but it just feels like we're being told to enjoy the view while the ship hits the iceberg. it's exhausting to keep pretending that any of this matters in the long run.",
